</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>pointer If successful, this function returns a pointer to re-allocated memory. This may be the same pointer as ptr, or a new pointer location. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Null If there is an error, NULL will be returned.</para>
</simplesect>
